{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:48:759","content":{"id":759,"title":"内置工具与 MCP","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果模型只能和我们聊天，不能操作我们的数据，那么就没办法进行提效，因此软件提供了大量的内置工具，点击侧边栏聊天下方的 MCP 管理中心就可以看到提供的内置工具"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_9b4b1a71-b7e0-4e3f-8fd6-7643da2fac24.webp","uuid":"ac8e7fc8-036d-4e4f-9536-5d586bc85295","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_9b4b1a71-b7e0-4e3f-8fd6-7643da2fac24.webp","width":465},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这些内置工具基本包括了对卡片、文章、知识库、项目文档的内容的查询，以及这些文档的更新情况，可以获取当前有哪些 Tab，当前打开的 Tab 是什么，对日历事件和日记的查询，对待办事件的查询，以及问题管理的查询，等等，基本上能手动操作的地方都可以通过聊天对话去完成。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我希望有一天，我们不用到处去各个 Tab 手动查看和查询，在这里发出一个指令，就可以获取到所有信息，并且可以发出指令去进行更新，比如完成一项待办，更新一篇文章，为卡片之间建立关联等等。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"除了使用内置工具，还支持配置外部 MCP 服务，比如我们可以去 "},{"type":"link","url":"https://modelscope.cn/mcp","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Model Scope"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的 MCP 广场找一个我们需要的服务"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2c45d4a0-ef52-407e-b775-b0444dee9df1.webp","uuid":"58aae56d-1d3b-474d-a395-209f0119f04c","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2c45d4a0-ef52-407e-b775-b0444dee9df1.webp","width":511},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"把右侧的服务配置复制下来粘贴到我们的 MCP 服务中，进行解析，完成后就可以使用提供的工具了。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_38f826b5-de3a-4284-aa25-658959f422b4.webp","uuid":"6c2241f3-4e89-4847-afe5-c5c590f975b7","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_38f826b5-de3a-4284-aa25-658959f422b4.webp","width":511},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"disableDrag":false}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"软件使用文档","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:735","type":"doc","id":735}},{"label":"AI","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:758","type":"doc","id":758}},{"label":"内置工具与 MCP","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:759","type":"doc","id":759}}],"prevPage":{"title":"工具调用、MCP、Skill……这些 AI 术语到底在说什么？","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:961","type":"doc","id":961}},"nextPage":{"title":"SKILL 管理","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:760","type":"doc","id":760}},"createTime":1766915900299,"updateTime":1777733321469,"projectId":48},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1777733321469}}